  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 1102.28 “Flow meter” means a device that measures the rate of flow of water through piping.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Env-Wq 1100) #8468, eff 11-1-05; ss by #10577, eff 5-1-14 (See Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Env-Wq 1100); ss by #13198, eff 5-1-21 (formerly Env-Wq 1102.26) (see Revision Note #3 at chapter heading for Env-Wq 1100)",
